Subject: [PATCH] Remove incident-related roots from the Snowflake CA bundle

Remove AAA Certificate Services and emSign ECC Root CA - G3, which
can anchor chains containing the compromised eMudhra intermediates.
Preserve every unrelated certificate, including the independently
self-signed SSL.com TLS ECC Root CA 2022 already in this bundle.
Leave OCSP and default TLS transport selection unchanged.

--- a/vendor/github.com/snowflakedb/gosnowflake/cacert.go
+++ b/vendor/github.com/snowflakedb/gosnowflake/cacert.go
@@ -114,30 +114,6 @@
 v52Vr2ua2J7p8eRDjeIRRDq/r72DQnNSi6q7pynP9WQcCk3RvKqsnyrQ/39/2n3qse0wJcGE2jTS
 W3iDVuycNsMm4hH2Z0kdkquM++v/eu6FSqdQgPCnXEqULl8FmTxSQeDNtGPPAUO6nIPcj2A781q0
 tHuu2guQOHXvgR1m0vdXcDazv/wor3ElhVsT/h5/WrQ8
------END CERTIFICATE-----
